      "source": "Returns whether the <a href=\"ElasticsearchPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.mapping\"><code>ElasticsearchPersistentEntity</code></a> has a <a href=\"../query/SeqNoPrimaryTerm.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.query\"><code>SeqNoPrimaryTerm</code></a> property. If this call\nreturns true, <a href=\"ElasticsearchPersistentEntity.html#getSeqNoPrimaryTermProperty()\"><code>ElasticsearchPersistentEntity.getSeqNoPrimaryTermProperty()</code></a> will return a non-null value.",
